1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,995
What if you were the last human alive?

2
00:00:04,495 --> 00:00:06,409
Imagine waking up one morning.

3
00:00:06,659 --> 00:00:08,214
You look outside your window,

4
00:00:08,264 --> 00:00:09,819
and something feels different.

5
00:00:10,069 --> 00:00:11,043
No cars.

6
00:00:11,093 --> 00:00:11,824
No people.

7
00:00:11,874 --> 00:00:12,755
No noise.

8
00:00:13,205 --> 00:00:14,725
You turn on your television.

9
00:00:14,775 --> 00:00:15,401
Nothing.

10
00:00:16,101 --> 00:00:17,238
You check your phone.

11
00:00:17,288 --> 00:00:18,285
No signal.

12
00:00:18,885 --> 00:00:20,150
You walk outside,

13
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,788
and suddenly you realize something terrifying.

14
00:00:23,038 --> 00:00:25,197
The entire world has gone silent.

15
00:00:25,997 --> 00:00:28,689
A nuclear war has destroyed civilization.

16
00:00:29,089 --> 00:00:30,911
Billions of people are dead.

17
00:00:31,261 --> 00:00:32,154
And somehow...

18
00:00:32,204 --> 00:00:33,596
You're still alive.

19
00:00:34,096 --> 00:00:37,938
But what happens next might be even worse than the explosion itself.

20
00:00:40,538 --> 00:00:42,534
At first, you might think you're lucky.

21
00:00:42,784 --> 00:00:44,641
You have food in your refrigerator.

22
00:00:44,891 --> 00:00:45,981
You have electricity.

23
00:00:46,381 --> 00:00:48,412
You have an entire city to yourself.

24
00:00:48,662 --> 00:00:53,526
But nuclear explosions leave behind something invisible and extremely dangerous:

25
00:00:53,576 --> 00:00:55,224
radioactive fallout.

26
00:00:55,724 --> 00:00:58,579
Depending on where you are and the direction of the wind,

27
00:00:58,629 --> 00:01:01,286
the surrounding environment could be contaminated.

28
00:01:01,586 --> 00:01:02,630
You need shelter.

29
00:01:02,980 --> 00:01:04,036
You need clean water.

30
00:01:04,386 --> 00:01:07,822
And most importantly, you need to avoid radioactive dust.

31
00:01:08,222 --> 00:01:09,927
Your phone is useless.

32
00:01:10,627 --> 00:01:12,147
Hospitals are empty.

33
00:01:12,497 --> 00:01:15,213
Emergency services no longer exist.

34
00:01:15,663 --> 00:01:17,682
For the first time in human history,

35
00:01:17,732 --> 00:01:19,589
there is nobody coming to save you.

